{"3736680": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "ClusterCluck", "steam_appid": 3736680, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🐔 About ClusterCluck and Mini-Games</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the coop!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ClusterCluck is an <strong>multiplayer social deduction game</strong> for 5 to 10 players where you try to find the hidden killer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the start of the game, each player is given a random role: Are you a cowardly chicken or a hungry fox? Be careful! Every fox in the coop might be wearing a chicken mask!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736680/extras/29ea6c2bb2acaff8fcd7272c3b4013b0.poster.avif?t=1771351131\" width=1080 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736680/extras/29ea6c2bb2acaff8fcd7272c3b4013b0.webm?t=1771351131\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736680/extras/29ea6c2bb2acaff8fcd7272c3b4013b0.mp4?t=1771351131\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Roles</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🐔 <strong>Chicken Team</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Chickens’ goal is to complete tasks, gather clues, and survive the night against the Foxes!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chicken:</strong> Uses eggs as defensive tools and is a master of quick escapes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Guard:</strong> Shields teammates and can create a massive protective barrier.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wizard:</strong> Resurrects fallen allies and clones itself to create chaos.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Seer:</strong> Turns invisible to reveal another player’s true identity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736680/extras/ef4b2b72e647a1299cec88aaa688b92e.poster.avif?t=1771351131\" width=1138 height=322 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736680/extras/ef4b2b72e647a1299cec88aaa688b92e.webm?t=1771351131\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736680/extras/ef4b2b72e647a1299cec88aaa688b92e.mp4?t=1771351131\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🦊 <strong>Fox Team</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Foxes’ goal is to secretly eliminate Chickens and manipulate the voting phase to their advantage.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fox:</strong> Tracks Chickens by scent, sets traps, and strikes with deadly attacks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Polar Fox:</strong> Freezes Chickens in place, stunning them and allowing allies to strike.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736680/extras/caaa021d77461f13744b6e8d247d1920.poster.avif?t=1771351131\" width=1138 height=322 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736680/extras/caaa021d77461f13744b6e8d247d1920.webm?t=1771351131\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736680/extras/caaa021d77461f13744b6e8d247d1920.mp4?t=1771351131\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🎮 <strong>Two Game Modes, Endless Chaos</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ClusterCluck adapts to your group size with two  game systems:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🐥 <strong>Quick Game (5-6 Players):</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1 Fox and 3 different Chicken roles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736680/extras/0fc971ccd80cd06cb380ec65d6915ec3.poster.avif?t=1771351131\" width=1138 height=322 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736680/extras/0fc971ccd80cd06cb380ec65d6915ec3.webm?t=1771351131\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736680/extras/0fc971ccd80cd06cb380ec65d6915ec3.mp4?t=1771351131\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🦊 <strong>Main Game (7–10 Players):</strong> <br>2 Foxes and 4 Chicken roles for full-scale chaos.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736680/extras/0f7a01d39c48f0e286dbeeee49c21afa.poster.avif?t=1771351131\" width=1138 height=322 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736680/extras/0f7a01d39c48f0e286dbeeee49c21afa.webm?t=1771351131\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736680/extras/0f7a01d39c48f0e286dbeeee49c21afa.mp4?t=1771351131\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🗝️ <strong>Mystery Chest</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🦉 The Owl's Chest</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the map and find the two hidden chests. These chests are very important. They give clues about who the killer might be. Each chicken can only open one chest per round.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736680/extras/b89ff144a4e3853cd638f51f70254782.poster.avif?t=1771351131\" width=1170 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736680/extras/b89ff144a4e3853cd638f51f70254782.webm?t=1771351131\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736680/extras/b89ff144a4e3853cd638f51f70254782.mp4?t=1771351131\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Missions: The Key to Escape</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The chicken coop doors are connected to an <strong>electrical system</strong>, but the system is <strong>inactive</strong>. To survive, run to the coop after completing team and individual tasks! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Team Mission – Fix the Switches:</strong><br>Repair the electrical system together to power up the coop.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quick Game: 4 switches</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Main Game: 6 switches</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736680/extras/5c1fbb11cacd5219f5ee6de004f7c64d.poster.avif?t=1771351131\" width=1138 height=322 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736680/extras/5c1fbb11cacd5219f5ee6de004f7c64d.webm?t=1771351131\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736680/extras/5c1fbb11cacd5219f5ee6de004f7c64d.mp4?t=1771351131\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Individual Mission – Rescue Your Chicks:</strong><br>Each Chicken must find and free their baby chicks trapped in cages around the map.<br>Rescue your chick, open the coop doors, and get a chance to advance to the voting stage.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736680/extras/0f81a04ad5bf004d49fca1ce33ec9b1a.poster.avif?t=1771351131\" width=1138 height=322 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736680/extras/0f81a04ad5bf004d49fca1ce33ec9b1a.webm?t=1771351131\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736680/extras/0f81a04ad5bf004d49fca1ce33ec9b1a.mp4?t=1771351131\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Two Phases of Suspense</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>1. Survival Phase:</strong><br>Foxes disguise themselves as Chickens, and suspicion spreads fast.<br>Complete your tasks, collect clues, and stay alert.<br>But beware, once the timer runs out, the Foxes will show their true faces!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736680/extras/c83940f6b215f1841dffbd89d1f0f591.poster.avif?t=1771351131\" width=1138 height=322 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736680/extras/c83940f6b215f1841dffbd89d1f0f591.webm?t=1771351131\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736680/extras/c83940f6b215f1841dffbd89d1f0f591.mp4?t=1771351131\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>2. Voting Phase:</strong><br>The survivors gather, accusations fly, and chaos takes over.<br>Trust the wrong player, and it could cost the entire coop.<br>If you’re a Fox, deception is your greatest weapon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In ClusterCluck, Trust Can Be Fatal.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736680/extras/3975d581aab3d0d9e334755b99730117.poster.avif?t=1771351131\" width=1080 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736680/extras/3975d581aab3d0d9e334755b99730117.webm?t=1771351131\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736680/extras/3975d581aab3d0d9e334755b99730117.mp4?t=1771351131\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Mini Game Mode: Cluck Up</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>(Parkour Mode)</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cluck Up is a parkour mode offering single-player and multiplayer experiences set in the ClusterCluck universe. The goal is simple: complete the course as quickly as possible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736680/extras/7bf3b3d0450af94d5a0962b21c3cacd6.poster.avif?t=1771351131\" width=1138 height=322 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736680/extras/7bf3b3d0450af94d5a0962b21c3cacd6.webm?t=1771351131\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736680/extras/7bf3b3d0450af94d5a0962b21c3cacd6.mp4?t=1771351131\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run, jump, maintain your balance… But if necessary, peck at your rivals or throw eggs to block their path.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Speed, reflexes, and chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🐔 About ClusterCluck and Mini-Games</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the coop!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ClusterCluck is an <strong>multiplayer social deduction game</str