team/apps/3736680/extras/b89ff144a4e3853cd638f51f70254782.mp4?t=1771351131\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Missions: The Key to Escape</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The chicken coop doors are connected to an <strong>electrical system</strong>, but the system is <strong>inactive</strong>. To survive, run to the coop after completing team and individual tasks! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Team Mission – Fix the Switches:</strong><br>Repair the electrical system together to power up the coop.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quick Game: 4 switches</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Main Game: 6 switches</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736680/extras/5c1fbb11cacd5219f5ee6de004f7c64d.poster.avif?t=1771351131\" width=1138 height=322 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736680/extras/5c1fbb11cacd5219f5ee6de004f7c64d.webm?t=1771351131\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736680/extras/5c1fbb11cacd5219f5ee6de004f7c64d.mp4?t=1771351131\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Individual Mission – Rescue Your Chicks:</strong><br>Each Chicken must find and free their baby chicks trapped in cages around the map.<br>Rescue your chick, open the coop doors, and get a chance to advance to the voting stage.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736680/extras/0f81a04ad5bf004d49fca1ce33ec9b1a.poster.avif?t=1771351131\" width=1138 height=322 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736680/extras/0f81a04ad5bf004d49fca1ce33ec9b1a.webm?t=1771351131\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736680/extras/0f81a04ad5bf004d49fca1ce33ec9b1a.mp4?t=1771351131\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Two Phases of Suspense</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>1. Survival Phase:</strong><br>Foxes disguise themselves as Chickens, and suspicion spreads fast.<br>Complete your tasks, collect clues, and stay alert.<br>But beware, once the timer runs out, the Foxes will show their true faces!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736680/extras/c83940f6b215f1841dffbd89d1f0f591.poster.avif?t=1771351131\" width=1138 height=322 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736680/extras/c83940f6b215f1841dffbd89d1f0f591.webm?t=1771351131\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736680/extras/c83940f6b215f1841dffbd89d1f0f591.mp4?t=1771351131\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>2. Voting Phase:</strong><br>The survivors gather, accusations fly, and chaos takes over.<br>Trust the wrong player, and it could cost the entire coop.<br>If you’re a Fox, deception is your greatest weapon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In ClusterCluck, Trust Can Be Fatal.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736680/extras/3975d581aab3d0d9e334755b99730117.poster.avif?t=1771351131\" width=1080 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736680/extras/3975d581aab3d0d9e334755b99730117.webm?t=1771351131\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736680/extras/3975d581aab3d0d9e334755b99730117.mp4?t=1771351131\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Mini Game Mode: Cluck Up</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>(Parkour Mode)</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cluck Up is a parkour mode offering single-player and multiplayer experiences set in the ClusterCluck universe. The goal is simple: complete the course as quickly as possible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736680/extras/7bf3b3d0450af94d5a0962b21c3cacd6.poster.avif?t=1771351131\" width=1138 height=322 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736680/extras/7bf3b3d0450af94d5a0962b21c3cacd6.webm?t=1771351131\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736680/extras/7bf3b3d0450af94d5a0962b21c3cacd6.mp4?t=1771351131\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run, jump, maintain your balance… But if necessary, peck at your rivals or throw eggs to block their path.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Speed, reflexes, and chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "ClusterCluck is a chaotic murder mystery game where not everyone is what they seem. Collect clues, complete tasks, deceive others and talk your way to safety. Whether hunting as a fox or surviving as a chicken, every player has unique skills that can change the game. Trust no one… and cluck wisely.", "supported_languages": "English, Turkish, Japanese, Russian, German, Spanish - Latin America", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736680/66a016c9ddba9a13d544897bc4c918b01b96bf32/header.jpg?t=1771351131", "capsule_image":